-- statement:
--   Prove the original-X/D strictly pre-stop discounted Itô–Stieltjes event budget on a genuine bounded right-continuous stopping clock whose entire positive-time prepayment reserve before that clock is separated below from zero by a positive deterministic floor. This isolates compact C2 Taylor, bounded predictable Gaussian L2 centring, original generator drift and cap-linear upper contact on original physical clipped cells; strict cash and time-zero right payment are retained. It is a materially restricted stochastic lemma, with final ruin localisation handled separately.
